note: say X, indented (2 spaces) and indented by N: every line of what is said.
let name be "Ana".
say "Top:".
say name, 95, indented.
say "two\nlines", indented by 4.
let depth be 1.
show name, indented by depth.
say "x", indented by 0.
to shout with indented:
    say "[indented]!", indented by 3.
shout with "nested".
